@startuml
title RF65 — Free agency e waivers · Máquina de estados: WaiverClaim.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "PENDING" as PENDING
PENDING : prazo de waivers correndo
PENDING : priority do clube
state "AWARDED" as AWARDED
AWARDED : menor priority
AWARDED : contrato herdado
state "LOST" as LOST
LOST : outro clube com prioridade
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> AWARDED : prazo vence: melhor prioridade
PENDING --> LOST : prazo vence: outro venceu ou sem cap
AWARDED --> [*]
LOST --> [*]
@enduml
